WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:01.980
Doremi-chan!

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:04.270
Could you possibly be-?

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.770
Ahhhhh! Don't say it!

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:07.980
What do I do?

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:10.490
If they find out I'm a witch...

00:00:10.490 --> 00:00:12.740
I told you so...

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.030
Guess you're gonna be a Witch Frog.

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:16.320
No way!

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.990
I really am the unluckiest pretty girl in the world!

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:51.830
Doremi-chan!

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.460
What's goin' on?

00:01:53.460 --> 00:01:55.300
Shut up and follow me!

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:56.840
Follow you where?

00:01:56.840 --> 00:01:58.340
I'll explain later...

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:00.930
Or maybe not...

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:02.930
What's wrong? Yer actin' funny.

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:05.600
Anyway, at this rate I'll...

00:02:06.680 --> 00:02:08.600
...become a Witch Frog!

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.400
Witch Frog?

00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:13.360
Anyway, just come with me!

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.530
It's Not Scary if We're All Witches.

00:02:24.330 --> 00:02:27.240
Makihatayama Rika's Maho-dou?

00:02:27.240 --> 00:02:30.250
I didn't know such a shop existed.

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.670
So, no matter what, you'll stay here?

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:33.780
What's goin' on?

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:35.460
Don't worry, don't worry!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:41.500
Be quiet and wait, okay?

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:44.140
What's goin' on?

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:45.970
Whaaaat!?

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.270
You've been discovered?

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.980
At this rate I'll become a Witch Frog!

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:51.940
No way, no way!

00:02:51.940 --> 00:02:53.560
Shut up, you idiot!

00:02:54.180 --> 00:02:55.770
Who saw you?

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:58.320
My friends Hadzuki-chan and Aiko-chan.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:01.160
Anyway, I brought them here too.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:03.180
It's okay.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:05.490
They're waiting outside...

00:03:09.080 --> 00:03:10.750
Why did you have to bring them along!?

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:13.370
Doremi-chan!

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:15.590
What was that just now?

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:17.210
Whatever are you talking about?

00:03:17.670 --> 00:03:19.240
No point hidin' them!

00:03:19.240 --> 00:03:22.760
A tadpole-lookin' creature and a winged-person!

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:25.680
They thought you were a tadpole.

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:29.350
Get back here!

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:31.680
They found out, so there's no helping it!

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.140
They already saw me anyway.

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.110
Oh well...

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:40.280
Weird friends ya have...

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:42.200
She's a fairy, Lala.

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:47.450
You know a fairy, so Doremi-chan, you must really be...

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.330
Doremi-chan's really a...

00:03:49.330 --> 00:03:50.560
Wait!

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:52.040
You're a witch, aren't you!?

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:55.880
Ahhhh! I've been completely unmasked!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.250
So I'm a Witch Frog now.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:02.000
Why are ya crouchin' like that?

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.050
Eh? Huh? Why?

00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:08.310
You're not a Witch Frog.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:09.430
Why?

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.220
Doremi, you're not a witch.

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:12.940
You're still a witch apprentice, aren't you?

00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:13.960
Apprentice?

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:16.050
That means...

00:04:16.050 --> 00:04:18.610
It was yer magic that made my dad suddenly disappear!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:20.280
Well, kinda...

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:22.900
But, I'm happy I didn't turn into a Witch Frog.

00:04:23.180 --> 00:04:24.730
Lucky, lucky!

00:04:24.730 --> 00:04:26.200
You idiot!

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.970
It's your fault that you were discovered!

00:04:29.970 --> 00:04:30.500
Sorry...

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:31.120
Jeez.

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:31.880
Doremi-chan...

00:04:31.880 --> 00:04:33.950
This person here is...

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.560
She's a witch, Majo Rika.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:37.560
A witch?

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:40.070
You don't look like a witch at all.

00:04:40.070 --> 00:04:41.380
Well, excuse me!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:43.700
I found out she was a witch,

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:45.680
so she turned into a Witch Frog.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:48.060
Well, I found out about Doremi-chan, so...

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.140
Stop it!

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:51.720
This time, she'll turn into a Witch Frog for sure!

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.840
Ah... I'm sorry...

00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:56.150
Hadzuki-chan...

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:57.660
But, what now?

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:01.280
These two know about Doremi's secret now.

00:05:01.280 --> 00:05:02.380
I won't tell.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.100
Yep!

00:05:04.100 --> 00:05:07.700
It'd be horrible if Doremi-chan turned into that!

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:09.240
No!

00:05:09.240 --> 00:05:11.660
The truth may come out at any time.

00:05:11.660 --> 00:05:13.540
Don't worry. It won't happen!

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.620
Shut up!

00:05:14.620 --> 00:05:18.580
If Doremi turns into a Witch Frog, it'll be impossible for me to turn back.

00:05:18.580 --> 00:05:20.550
If that's the case...

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:21.500
Don't tell me...

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.170
you'll use magic on them?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.170
No way!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.220
Who said I would do that?

00:05:27.720 --> 00:05:30.580
I'm gonna make you two apprentices too.

00:05:30.580 --> 00:05:33.600
It's good that we have two more apprentice Taps.

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.120
Then I'll be a witch someday?

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:37.440
Right.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:42.230
However you mustn't let anyone find out about your secret, okay?

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:44.820
Ai-chan!

00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:49.570
Let's be witches together!

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:53.790
If you become one, you can cast anything and it will come true!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.040
Anything?

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:59.420
So I can get anything I desire?

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:03.420
Maybe if I do this, Dad can finally have some time to relax.

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:04.670
Alright!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:07.100
I'm gonna be a witch apprentice!

00:06:07.440 --> 00:06:08.410
Me too!

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:09.630
Alright!

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:12.970
Then we're all gonna be witch apprentice friends!

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:19.190
Well, there are apprentice Taps in here, so take one each.

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:19.720
'Kay!

00:06:25.780 --> 00:06:26.580
Next!

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:27.320
Okay.

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:30.530
I caught one.

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.040
Doremi!

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.530
Leave it to me!

00:06:33.530 --> 00:06:36.530
First, press the middle button!

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.500
You have to put it on before the music ends.

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.540
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:54.310
Now then, let's see you two try it!

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:55.960
Okay, Sempai!

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:57.060
Sempai?

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:58.740
That sounds good!

00:06:58.740 --> 00:07:00.810
One more time! One more time!

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:02.930
Sempai!

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:03.930
This is bliss!

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:06.280
Don't get big-headed, you Ojamajo!

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.650
Ojamajo?

00:07:07.650 --> 00:07:11.030
This apprentice is a bothersome witch, so she's an Ojamajo.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:14.450
Jeez, I was in the mood to teach them too.

00:07:17.940 --> 00:07:19.080
Well, you two...

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:19.880
Shall we try it?

00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:21.210
Okay!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.580
I'll go first!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:37.430
Pretty Witchy Aiko-chi!

00:07:37.970 --> 00:07:39.180
Me too!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:49.190
My glasses...

00:07:55.260 --> 00:07:57.120
Found Ojamajo number two...

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:00.000
If you can't wear your uniform you can't be an apprentice!

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:01.080
Right!

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:12.680
Help her!

00:08:19.350 --> 00:08:20.930
Safe!

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:23.940
Don't sigh, you idiot!

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:27.310
Now hurry up and practice!

00:08:27.310 --> 00:08:28.810
Yes, ma'am.

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:32.070
Next is the magic casting lesson...

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:34.340
Sempai will teach you how!

00:08:34.980 --> 00:08:36.780
First you do a Do-Mi-So-Do!

00:08:43.360 --> 00:08:44.840
Tada!

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.020
This is called a Peperuto Poron!

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:48.170
A magic stick, right?

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:50.120
You're such a newbie, Aiko-chan!

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:54.050
This is not a stick, but a musical instrument from the Witch World.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.000
A musical instrument?

00:08:55.000 --> 00:08:57.760
A musical instrument from the Witch World that can cast magic!

00:08:57.760 --> 00:08:59.930
You spoke like you even knew.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.920
Don't interrupt my lesson!

00:09:02.920 --> 00:09:03.900
Right, right!

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:05.140
Jeez!

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.300
Well then!

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:08.240
Here's lesson number one!

00:09:10.180 --> 00:09:12.980
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.690
Big tasty steak, appear!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:22.660
It's time to...

00:09:23.740 --> 00:09:25.500
Just as I thought, I can't do that...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:27.000
Such a comedian.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.940
Let's try it too!

00:09:28.940 --> 00:09:29.920
Sure!

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:51.440
Both of them have different Porons from me.

00:09:51.780 --> 00:09:54.320
They're called Poppun Poron and Puwapuwa Poron.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:58.910
Hadzuki's spell is Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:02.160
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu?

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.460
Right.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:07.160
Aiko's spell is Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun.

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:08.960
Pameku Ruruku?

00:10:08.960 --> 00:10:10.920
Pameruku Laruku!

00:10:10.920 --> 00:10:12.540
Pameruku Laruku...

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.680
Next is... what?

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:17.780
Larilori Poppun!

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:20.930
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun, right?

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.210
Alright!

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:24.180
Now I'm gonna get some takoyaki!

00:10:24.920 --> 00:10:29.690
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:10:30.020 --> 00:10:32.430
Takoyaki, come out!

00:10:36.650 --> 00:10:38.320
No good.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.120
This ain't no takoyaki (octopus dumplings), it's yakitako (fried octopus)...

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:42.570
Alright, I'll try again!

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:43.280
This one is also an Ojamajo...

00:10:43.280 --> 00:10:45.320
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:47.280
On top of that..

00:10:47.280 --> 00:10:48.070
Takoyaki, come out!

00:10:48.070 --> 00:10:49.470
Stop it!

00:10:49.470 --> 00:10:52.920
You're wasting your precious magic spheres!
Takoyaki, come out!

00:10:52.920 --> 00:10:54.410
Magic spheres?

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.750
The spheres inside the Poron!

00:10:58.880 --> 00:10:59.580
Yer right!

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.100
How many do you think you've used?

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:03.620
Excuse me?

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.560
May I try too?

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:09.560
Maybe you should try something easy for your first time.

00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.810
Well, try to make something move.

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:12.690
Okay!

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.660
I wonder what I should do.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:16.940
That's so cute!

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:18.280
I'll try that!

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:23.780
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:11:23.780 --> 00:11:27.030
Mr. Mouse, move!

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:34.620
She's pretty good!

00:11:34.620 --> 00:11:36.840
Even better than Doremi!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:38.140
What was that?

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:39.260
What?

00:11:39.260 --> 00:11:41.510
I'll show you!

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:46.470
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:11:46.470 --> 00:11:48.970
I don't care what, just move!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:07.700
Doremi!

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:10.610
Hurry and cancel your magic before it destroys the shop!

00:12:10.610 --> 00:12:15.330
Even if you say that, you haven't taught me how to cancel my magic!

00:12:39.920 --> 00:12:43.950
Doremi's magic needs to be worked on. So far it has only brought disaster.

00:12:45.400 --> 00:12:46.610
Hey, Majo Rika...

00:12:47.730 --> 00:12:52.490
Shouldn't you give them a proper lesson about forbidden magic?

00:12:53.120 --> 00:12:54.960
Forbidden magic?

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:58.880
Such magic... exists?

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:00.450
Sure it does.

00:13:00.450 --> 00:13:05.380
If you cast such magic, bad things will happen to you, so don't do it.

00:13:05.380 --> 00:13:08.550
First is magic that brings the dead back to life.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:10.510
What if it's cast by accident?

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:13.430
I believe that the caster will die.

00:13:14.480 --> 00:13:17.050
Next is healing magic.

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:20.440
Eh? So if I lost my voice, I couldn't heal it?

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:25.950
If you use it, something will happen to your own body, so it's best if you don't.

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:28.340
So...

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.860
That time at the soccer match...

00:13:33.080 --> 00:13:35.660
So that's what happened...

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:36.860
That's right.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:41.050
I really wish you could take level 9 exam soon.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.500
Level 9?

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:45.050
There are exams to become a witch?

00:13:45.050 --> 00:13:46.150
Right!

00:13:46.150 --> 00:13:47.040
And then...

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:47.660
Listen!

00:13:47.660 --> 00:13:50.850
If we pass the level 9 exam, we'll get fairies like Lala!

00:13:54.350 --> 00:13:56.290
Sounds like fun!

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:57.630
Right? Right?

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:58.350
At any rate!

00:13:58.350 --> 00:14:00.850
Practice your magic!

00:14:01.770 --> 00:14:02.920
Then...

00:14:02.920 --> 00:14:04.740
Give us magic spheres please!

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:06.090
Jeez!

00:14:06.090 --> 00:14:08.600
Lala, get the magic spheres out!

00:14:08.600 --> 00:14:09.610
The thing is...

00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.870
We're completely out.

00:14:13.700 --> 00:14:15.660
Guess I have to get more of them.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.420
Looks like we can't practice then, Majo Rika-chan!

00:14:20.240 --> 00:14:21.320
Can't help it.

00:14:21.320 --> 00:14:23.170
Gotta go buy more then.

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.800
You buy magic spheres?

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:26.990
Right!

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:28.290
They're sold in the Witch World.

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.890
I can give you money to buy them.

00:14:31.890 --> 00:14:34.680
If it were that easy, I would've bought them already.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.640
We can't buy them with money?

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:38.520
Of course we can buy them with money!

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:42.480
This shop's magic goods haven't really earned me any money, though.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:46.940
If I give you 100 yen, isn't it still 100 yen over there?

00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:51.410
In the Witch World, your money is worthless!

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:56.410
So, if we don't sell a lot of magic goods, we won't be able to buy magic spheres,

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:59.370
thus we won't get better at magic?

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.310
That's exactly right!

00:15:01.310 --> 00:15:02.330
You learn fast, Hadzuki!

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:04.240
That's right!

00:15:04.240 --> 00:15:08.300
Hadzuki-chan is the number one student in our class!

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:09.680
And you're last...

00:15:10.710 --> 00:15:14.330
In any case, get to sleep early and come work for me tomorrow.

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.580
Like I said...

00:15:15.580 --> 00:15:16.880
Sounds interestin' to me!

00:15:17.640 --> 00:15:21.370
If we worked in the shop, wouldn't that be wonderful?

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.140
Yep!

00:15:22.640 --> 00:15:25.270
Being a merchant is in my Naniwa blood!

00:15:25.270 --> 00:15:27.230
Let's do it, Doremi-chan!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.490
Okay?

00:15:29.060 --> 00:15:30.490
Come on, come on!

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:32.320
Sure.

00:15:32.320 --> 00:15:34.730
Alright, let's do our best!

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:36.140
Yeah!

00:15:36.610 --> 00:15:38.820
But, this shop is...

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.650
A bit out of fashion, isn't it?

00:15:41.650 --> 00:15:43.480
What did you say?

00:15:43.480 --> 00:15:45.420
What do you mean by...

00:15:45.420 --> 00:15:48.550
OUT OF FASHION!?

00:15:50.040 --> 00:15:52.170
Majo Rika sure got angry.

00:15:52.170 --> 00:15:54.590
It was kinda bad, wasn't it?

00:15:55.340 --> 00:15:57.140
I guess so.

00:15:57.840 --> 00:16:00.120
Even the shop's name is weird.

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:02.590
We ain't gettin' customers if it stays that way.

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:07.390
Look, Majo Rika!

00:16:07.390 --> 00:16:08.480
The moon is smiling.

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.660
You can go to the Witch World.

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:14.320
But I don't have any business there!

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:18.290
Don't we need some shop items and trading goods?

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:20.250
Guess you're right.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.210
I'll take that mess with me then.

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.380
Well then, I'm off!

00:16:40.050 --> 00:16:43.000
I'll be back tomorrow evening.

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.020
I'm trusting you with everything.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.970
Have a safe trip!

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.370
You're remodeling the shop?

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:02.040
But, from now on, this is gonna be our shop too.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:05.030
We just want to get things ready.

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:08.000
No go?

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.960
Oh well, it sounds interesting.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.670
Really?

00:17:12.670 --> 00:17:16.520
If you ask me, I'd say it is out of fashion.

00:17:16.520 --> 00:17:17.380
That's great!

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:19.260
Hey!

00:17:21.670 --> 00:17:22.510
Ai-chan?

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:24.180
Up here, up here!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:26.770
Sorry, sorry!

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:29.010
I overslept!

00:17:29.760 --> 00:17:30.680
How?

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:35.280
How can you ride your broom without us teaching you?

00:17:35.280 --> 00:17:37.480
At first, I couldn't either.

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:39.280
But this guy...

00:17:41.690 --> 00:17:43.170
Hey, idiot!

00:17:43.170 --> 00:17:44.960
What the heck're ya doin'?

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:46.680
Fly straight!

00:17:46.680 --> 00:17:48.160
Or else...

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:51.670
You. Do it better this time!

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.830
Or, I'll make you suffer!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.170
So shall we go?

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:01.470
That's the story.

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:03.430
Amazing threat.

00:18:03.430 --> 00:18:06.870
Later, please teach me how to ride a broom too, okay?

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:07.890
Leave it to me!

00:18:07.890 --> 00:18:10.730
Hey, by the way, where's Majo Rika?

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:12.430
She's shopping in the Witch World.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:14.390
Good timing!

00:18:14.890 --> 00:18:15.860
Chance!

00:18:16.560 --> 00:18:17.160
Yeah!

00:18:18.440 --> 00:18:20.200
First, we should change the name.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.260
The Maho-dou part's good.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:23.770
Get rid of the rest.

00:18:23.770 --> 00:18:24.870
I agree!

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:25.790
If that's the case,

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:27.420
let's do it in Romaji!

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:30.080
How does M-A-H-O sound?

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.900
That's cool!

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.500
Right! Right!

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:34.710
Alright!

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:39.230
Let's do our best remodeling!

00:18:39.230 --> 00:18:40.260
Yeah!

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:31.690
Be there!
Come to the Maho-dou for your magic goods!
For your happiness...

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.650
What the heck is this?

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:36.610
Welcome back!

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:38.060
What? What!?

00:19:38.060 --> 00:19:41.120
This doesn't look at all like a witch shop!

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:43.440
It was all weird and creepy before.

00:19:43.440 --> 00:19:44.480
Right! Right!

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.700
It looks much nicer this way.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.660
My shop...

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:50.550
I think it's better this way.

00:19:50.550 --> 00:19:51.580
What!?

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:55.950
What did you guys do?

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:58.580
I think this looks better too.

00:19:58.580 --> 00:20:00.050
It's too flashy!

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:02.000
It's a lot cooler this way!

00:20:02.630 --> 00:20:05.380
And it goes with the cute accessories.

00:20:05.380 --> 00:20:06.810
Accessories, you say?

00:20:06.810 --> 00:20:11.100
We're planning to sell cheap magic goods.

00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:13.100
You idiots!

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.950
Expensive or not, it was decided long ago!

00:20:16.950 --> 00:20:17.860
Think about it!

00:20:17.860 --> 00:20:20.240
We can't sell anything gloomy!

00:20:20.240 --> 00:20:26.280
Without some skill and a pleasing setup, we ain't gonna sell anything!

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:27.900
That's the Naniwa spirit!

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:29.620
Thank you! Thank you!

00:20:29.620 --> 00:20:31.540
You Ojamajos!

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:34.120
And YOU. How could you let them do this?

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.340
Huh? I approved of everything these girls did.

00:20:38.530 --> 00:20:41.890
Compared to the old shop, this one is definitely better.

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:45.300
What did you saaaaaay!?

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:49.050
I give up! Do what you want!

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:53.570
So is it okay to give these girls the magic clay?

00:20:53.570 --> 00:20:54.760
Do what you want!

00:20:55.890 --> 00:20:57.090
Alright!

00:21:01.690 --> 00:21:04.650
Wow, Ai-chan's is cute!

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:07.350
Hadzuki-chan's necklace looks good too!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:09.360
This side, however...

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:11.570
What about it?

00:21:12.230 --> 00:21:14.040
Are they rings?

00:21:15.360 --> 00:21:18.340
Doremi-chan's design is definitely one of a kind.

00:21:18.340 --> 00:21:20.200
<i>I</i>  wouldn't put 'em on display.

00:21:21.160 --> 00:21:23.070
This is my art!

00:21:23.070 --> 00:21:24.470
Don't flatter yourself!

00:21:24.470 --> 00:21:26.560
W-What?

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:27.460
Jeez!

00:21:29.590 --> 00:21:30.620
Come on now!

00:21:30.620 --> 00:21:32.000
It's getting late.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:33.940
Let's do more next time.

00:21:33.940 --> 00:21:34.850
'Kay!

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:37.350
See you then Lala!

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:39.220
See you!

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:40.430
See ya tomorrow!

00:21:43.360 --> 00:21:45.990
We're opening tomorrow!

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:49.440
If we sell a lot, we're gonna get our magic spheres too!

00:21:49.440 --> 00:21:50.450
Yeah!

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.990
This is our shop!

00:21:52.990 --> 00:21:55.650
Alright, let's do our best!

00:21:55.650 --> 00:21:57.350
Yeah!

00:22:01.990 --> 00:22:06.480
Jeez, I was happy about our new shop, but...

00:22:06.480 --> 00:22:08.590
Why don't we have any customers?

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:12.600
And after all the work we've done making magic goods...

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:13.450
I got it!

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:16.240
If we advertise, we'll definitely get customers!

00:22:16.240 --> 00:22:19.060
We'll advertise all over, and they'll come pourin' in!

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:20.220
Yeah!

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:22.760
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.760 --> 00:22:25.020
Grand Opening! Maho-dou.

00:22:25.430 --> 00:22:27.650
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
